[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forbole/callisto/releases/109947541","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forbole/callisto/releases/109947541/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/forbole/callisto/releases/109947541/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/forbole/callisto/releases/tag/v4.0.0","id":109947541,"author":{"login":"rmontagnin","id":9119016,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxMTkwMTY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9119016?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin","html_url":"https://github.com/rmontagnin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDODx6xrs4GjaqV","tag_name":"v4.0.0","target_commitish":"cosmos/v0.47.x","name":"v4.0.0","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2023-06-26T17:32:42Z","updated_at":"2023-06-26T17:35:39Z","published_at":"2023-06-26T17:35:04Z","assets":[],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forbole/callisto/tarball/v4.0.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forbole/callisto/zipball/v4.0.0","body":"## Notes\r\nThis version is thought to be used with Cosmos SDK `v0.47.x`.\r\n\r\n## Changes\r\n\r\n### Parse Command\r\n- ([\\#492](https://github.com/forbole/bdjuno/pull/492)) Add parse command for periodic tasks: `x/bank` total supply, `x/distribution` community pool, `x/mint` inflation, `pricefeed` token price and price history, `x/staking` staking pool\r\n\r\n### Upgrade Module\r\n- ([\\#467](https://github.com/forbole/bdjuno/pull/467)) Store software upgrade plan and refresh data at upgrade height\r\n\r\n### Staking Module\r\n- ([\\#443](https://github.com/forbole/bdjuno/pull/443)) Remove tombstone status from staking module(already stored in slashing module)\r\n- ([\\#455](https://github.com/forbole/bdjuno/pull/455)) Added `unbonding_tokens` and `staked_not_bonded_tokens` values to staking pool table\r\n- ([\\#536](https://github.com/forbole/bdjuno/pull/536)) Fix `PoolSnapshot` tokens type from  `sdk.Int` to `sdkmath.Int`\r\n\r\n### Gov Module\r\n- ([\\#461](https://github.com/forbole/bdjuno/pull/461)) Parse `x/gov` genesis with `genesisDoc.InitialHeight` instead of the hard-coded height 1\r\n- ([\\#465](https://github.com/forbole/bdjuno/pull/465)) Get open proposal ids in deposit or voting period by block time instead of current time\r\n- ([\\#489](https://github.com/forbole/bdjuno/pull/489)) Remove block height foreign key from proposal_vote and proposal_deposit tables and add column timestamp\r\n- ([\\#499](https://github.com/forbole/bdjuno/pull/499)) Check if proposal has passed voting end time before marking it invalid\r\n- ([\\#523](https://github.com/forbole/bdjuno/pull/523)) Update proposal snapshots handling on block\r\n\r\n### Daily refetch\r\n- ([\\#454](https://github.com/forbole/bdjuno/pull/454)) Added `daily refetch` module to refetch missing blocks every day\r\n\r\n### Hasura\r\n- ([\\#473](https://github.com/forbole/bdjuno/pull/473)) Improved Hasura permissions\r\n- ([\\#491](https://github.com/forbole/bdjuno/pull/491)) Add host address to Hasura actions\r\n\r\n### Dependencies\r\n- ([\\#542](https://github.com/forbole/bdjuno/pull/542)) Updated Juno to `v5.1.0`"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forbole/callisto/releases/73539201","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forbole/callisto/releases/73539201/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/forbole/callisto/releases/73539201/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/forbole/callisto/releases/tag/v3.2.0-stargate","id":73539201,"author":{"login":"rmontagnin","id":9119016,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxMTkwMTY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9119016?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin","html_url":"https://github.com/rmontagnin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDODx6xrs4EYh6B","tag_name":"v3.2.0-stargate","target_commitish":"cosmos/v0.44.x","name":"v3.2.0-stargate","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2022-08-03T13:23:37Z","updated_at":"2022-08-03T13:26:29Z","published_at":"2022-08-03T13:25:05Z","assets":[],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forbole/callisto/tarball/v3.2.0-stargate","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forbole/callisto/zipball/v3.2.0-stargate","body":"## Cosmos compatibility\r\nThis tag is thought to be used with chains that are running Cosmos **Stargate**. If you want to integrate with a chain running Cosmos `v0.43.0` or later, please use [`v3.2.0`](https://github.com/forbole/bdjuno/releases/tag/v3.2.0) instead.\r\n\r\n## Changes\r\n### Mint module\r\n- ([\\#432](https://github.com/forbole/bdjuno/pull/432)) Update inflation rate when mint param change proposal is passed\r\n\r\n### Gov module\r\n- ([\\#401](https://github.com/forbole/bdjuno/pull/401)) Update the proposal status to the latest in `bdjuno parse gov proposal [id]` command\r\n- ([\\#430](https://github.com/forbole/bdjuno/pull/430)) Update the proposals that have invalid status but can still be in voting or deposit periods \r\n\r\n## Dependencies\r\n- ([\\#440](https://github.com/forbole/bdjuno/pull/440)) Updated Juno to `v3.3.0`\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forbole/callisto/releases/73539201/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forbole/callisto/releases/73539131","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forbole/callisto/releases/73539131/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/forbole/callisto/releases/73539131/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/forbole/callisto/releases/tag/v3.2.0","id":73539131,"author":{"login":"rmontagnin","id":9119016,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxMTkwMTY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9119016?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin","html_url":"https://github.com/rmontagnin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDODx6xrs4EYh47","tag_name":"v3.2.0","target_commitish":"cosmos/v0.44.x","name":"v3.2.0","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2022-08-03T13:19:23Z","updated_at":"2022-08-03T13:26:40Z","published_at":"2022-08-03T13:24:22Z","assets":[],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forbole/callisto/tarball/v3.2.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forbole/callisto/zipball/v3.2.0","body":"## Cosmos compatibility\r\nThis tag is thought to be used with chains that are running Cosmos **`v0.43.0` or later**. If you want to integrate with a chain running Cosmos Stargate, please use [`v3.2.0-stargate`](https://github.com/forbole/bdjuno/releases/tag/v3.2.0-stargate) instead.\r\n\r\n## Changes\r\n### Mint module\r\n- ([\\#432](https://github.com/forbole/bdjuno/pull/432)) Update inflation rate when mint param change proposal is passed\r\n\r\n### Gov module\r\n- ([\\#401](https://github.com/forbole/bdjuno/pull/401)) Update the proposal status to the latest in `bdjuno parse gov proposal [id]` command\r\n- ([\\#430](https://github.com/forbole/bdjuno/pull/430)) Update the proposals that have invalid status but can still be in voting or deposit periods \r\n\r\n## Dependencies\r\n- ([\\#440](https://github.com/forbole/bdjuno/pull/440)) Updated Juno to `v3.3.0`\r\n"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forbole/callisto/releases/68020917","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forbole/callisto/releases/68020917/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/forbole/callisto/releases/68020917/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/forbole/callisto/releases/tag/v3.1.0-stargate","id":68020917,"author":{"login":"rmontagnin","id":9119016,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxMTkwMTY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9119016?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin","html_url":"https://github.com/rmontagnin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDODx6xrs4EDeq1","tag_name":"v3.1.0-stargate","target_commitish":"cosmos/v0.44.x","name":"v3.1.0-stargate","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2022-05-27T13:40:33Z","updated_at":"2022-05-27T13:43:18Z","published_at":"2022-05-27T13:43:18Z","assets":[],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forbole/callisto/tarball/v3.1.0-stargate","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forbole/callisto/zipball/v3.1.0-stargate","body":"## Cosmos compatibility\r\nThis tag is thought to be used with chains that are running Cosmos **Stargate**. If you want to integrate with a chain running Cosmos `v0.43.0` or later, please use [`v3.1.0`](https://github.com/forbole/bdjuno/releases/tag/v3.1.0) instead.\r\n\r\n## Dependencies\r\n- ([\\#412](https://github.com/forbole/bdjuno/pull/412)) Updated Juno to `v3.2.1`\r\n\r\n## Changes \r\n### Hasura\r\n- ([\\#395](https://github.com/forbole/bdjuno/pull/395)) Remove time label from Hasura Prometheus monitoring\r\n\r\n### Bank module\r\n- ([\\#410](https://github.com/forbole/bdjuno/pull/410)) Change total supply query from only 1 page to all pages"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forbole/callisto/releases/68020830","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forbole/callisto/releases/68020830/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/forbole/callisto/releases/68020830/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/forbole/callisto/releases/tag/v3.1.0","id":68020830,"author":{"login":"rmontagnin","id":9119016,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxMTkwMTY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9119016?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin","html_url":"https://github.com/rmontagnin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDODx6xrs4EDepe","tag_name":"v3.1.0","target_commitish":"cosmos/v0.44.x","name":"v3.1.0","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2022-05-27T13:39:56Z","updated_at":"2022-05-27T13:42:10Z","published_at":"2022-05-27T13:42:10Z","assets":[],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forbole/callisto/tarball/v3.1.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forbole/callisto/zipball/v3.1.0","body":"## Cosmos compatibility\r\nThis tag is thought to be used with chains that are running Cosmos **`v0.43.0` or later**. If you want to integrate with a chain running Cosmos Stargate, please use [`v3.1.0-stargate`](https://github.com/forbole/bdjuno/releases/tag/v3.1.0-stargate) instead.\r\n\r\n## Dependencies\r\n- ([\\#412](https://github.com/forbole/bdjuno/pull/412)) Updated Juno to `v3.2.1`\r\n\r\n## Changes \r\n### Hasura\r\n- ([\\#395](https://github.com/forbole/bdjuno/pull/395)) Remove time label from Hasura Prometheus monitoring\r\n\r\n### Bank module\r\n- ([\\#410](https://github.com/forbole/bdjuno/pull/410)) Change total supply query from only 1 page to all pages"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forbole/callisto/releases/64248115","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forbole/callisto/releases/64248115/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/forbole/callisto/releases/64248115/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/forbole/callisto/releases/tag/v3.0.1-stargate","id":64248115,"author":{"login":"rmontagnin","id":9119016,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxMTkwMTY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9119016?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin","html_url":"https://github.com/rmontagnin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDODx6xrs4D1Fkz","tag_name":"v3.0.1-stargate","target_commitish":"cosmos/v0.44.x","name":"v3.0.1-stargate","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2022-04-12T13:51:49Z","updated_at":"2022-05-27T13:43:01Z","published_at":"2022-04-12T13:58:35Z","assets":[],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forbole/callisto/tarball/v3.0.1-stargate","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forbole/callisto/zipball/v3.0.1-stargate","body":"## Cosmos compatibility\r\nThis tag is thought to be used with chains that are running Cosmos **Stargate**. If you want to integrate with a chain running Cosmos `v0.43.0` or later, please use [`v3.0.1`](https://github.com/forbole/bdjuno/releases/tag/v3.0.1) instead.\r\n\r\n## Changes\r\nThis version replaces [`v3.0.0-stargate`](https://github.com/forbole/bdjuno/releases/tag/v3.0.0-stargate) with a minor update to solve an initialization bug. "},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forbole/callisto/releases/64247593","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forbole/callisto/releases/64247593/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/forbole/callisto/releases/64247593/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/forbole/callisto/releases/tag/v3.0.1","id":64247593,"author":{"login":"rmontagnin","id":9119016,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxMTkwMTY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9119016?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin","html_url":"https://github.com/rmontagnin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDODx6xrs4D1Fcp","tag_name":"v3.0.1","target_commitish":"cosmos/v0.44.x","name":"v3.0.1","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2022-04-12T13:53:30Z","updated_at":"2022-05-27T13:42:26Z","published_at":"2022-04-12T13:54:46Z","assets":[],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forbole/callisto/tarball/v3.0.1","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forbole/callisto/zipball/v3.0.1","body":"## Cosmos compatibility\r\nThis tag is thought to be used with chains that are running Cosmos **`v0.43.0` or later**. If you want to integrate with a chain running Cosmos Stargate, please use [`v3.0.1-stargate`](https://github.com/forbole/bdjuno/releases/tag/v3.0.1-stargate) instead.\r\n\r\n## Changes\r\nThis version replaces [`v3.0.0`](https://github.com/forbole/bdjuno/releases/tag/v3.0.0) with a minor update to solve an initialization bug. "},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forbole/callisto/releases/64204171","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forbole/callisto/releases/64204171/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/forbole/callisto/releases/64204171/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/forbole/callisto/releases/tag/v3.0.0-stargate","id":64204171,"author":{"login":"rmontagnin","id":9119016,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxMTkwMTY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9119016?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin","html_url":"https://github.com/rmontagnin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDODx6xrs4D062L","tag_name":"v3.0.0-stargate","target_commitish":"cosmos/stargate","name":"v3.0.0-stargate","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2022-04-12T07:06:46Z","updated_at":"2022-04-12T13:56:38Z","published_at":"2022-04-12T07:11:25Z","assets":[],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forbole/callisto/tarball/v3.0.0-stargate","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forbole/callisto/zipball/v3.0.0-stargate","body":"# ⚠️ PLEASE DO NOT USE ⚠️\r\nThis version contains a bug which makes it impossible to be used due to different IBC version being used at the same time. Please use [`v3.0.1-stargate`](https://github.com/forbole/bdjuno/releases/tag/v3.0.1-stargate) instead.\r\n\r\n## Notes\r\nThis version introduces breaking changes to `transaction` and `message` PostgreSQL tables. It implements PostgreSQL table partitioning to fix slow data retrieval from database that stores large amount of transactions and messages. Read more details about [migrating to v3.0.0](https://docs.bigdipper.live/cosmos-based/parser/migrations/v2.0.0)\r\n\r\n## Cosmos compatibility\r\nThis tag is thought to be used with chains that are running Cosmos **Stargate**. If you want to integrate with a chain running Cosmos `v0.43.0` or later, please use [`v3.0.0`](https://github.com/forbole/bdjuno/releases/tag/v3.0.0) instead.\r\n\r\n## Changelog\r\n### New features \r\n#### CLI\r\n- ([\\#356](https://github.com/forbole/bdjuno/pull/356)) Implemented `migrate` command to perform easy migration to higher BDJuno versions\r\n- ([\\#356](https://github.com/forbole/bdjuno/pull/356)) Updated `parse-genesis` command to parse genesis file without accessing the node\r\n\r\n#### Database\r\n- ([\\#356](https://github.com/forbole/bdjuno/pull/356)) Added PostgreSQL table partition to `transaction` and `message` table\r\n- ([\\#356](https://github.com/forbole/bdjuno/pull/356)) Created new `messages_by_address` function\r\n\r\n### Changes \r\n#### Hasura\r\n- ([\\#377](https://github.com/forbole/bdjuno/pull/377)) Updated Hasura metadata\r\n- ([\\#381](https://github.com/forbole/bdjuno/pull/381)) Hasura actions are now a module \r\n\r\n### Dependencies\r\n- ([\\#356](https://github.com/forbole/bdjuno/pull/356)) Updated Juno to `v3.0.0`\r\n"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forbole/callisto/releases/64204411","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forbole/callisto/releases/64204411/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/forbole/callisto/releases/64204411/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/forbole/callisto/releases/tag/v3.0.0","id":64204411,"author":{"login":"rmontagnin","id":9119016,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxMTkwMTY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9119016?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin","html_url":"https://github.com/rmontagnin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDODx6xrs4D0657","tag_name":"v3.0.0","target_commitish":"cosmos/v0.44.x","name":"v3.0.0","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2022-04-12T07:08:40Z","updated_at":"2022-04-12T13:56:20Z","published_at":"2022-04-12T07:15:50Z","assets":[],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forbole/callisto/tarball/v3.0.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forbole/callisto/zipball/v3.0.0","body":"# ⚠️ PLEASE DO NOT USE ⚠️\r\nThis version contains a bug which makes it impossible to be used due to different IBC version being used at the same time. Please use [`v3.0.1`](https://github.com/forbole/bdjuno/releases/tag/v3.0.1) instead.\r\n\r\n## Notes\r\nThis version introduces breaking changes to `transaction` and `message` PostgreSQL tables. It implements PostgreSQL table partitioning to fix slow data retrieval from database that stores large amount of transactions and messages. Read more details about [migrating to v3.0.0](https://docs.bigdipper.live/cosmos-based/parser/migrations/v2.0.0)\r\n\r\n## Cosmos compatibility\r\nThis tag is thought to be used with chains that are running Cosmos **`v0.43.0` or later**. If you want to integrate with a chain running Cosmos Stargate, please use [`v3.0.0-stargate`](https://github.com/forbole/bdjuno/releases/tag/v3.0.0-stargate) instead.\r\n\r\n## Changelog\r\n### New features \r\n#### CLI\r\n- ([\\#356](https://github.com/forbole/bdjuno/pull/356)) Implemented `migrate` command to perform easy migration to higher BDJuno versions\r\n- ([\\#356](https://github.com/forbole/bdjuno/pull/356)) Updated `parse-genesis` command to parse genesis file without accessing the node\r\n\r\n#### Database\r\n- ([\\#356](https://github.com/forbole/bdjuno/pull/356)) Added PostgreSQL table partition to `transaction` and `message` table\r\n- ([\\#356](https://github.com/forbole/bdjuno/pull/356)) Created new `messages_by_address` function\r\n\r\n### Changes \r\n#### Hasura\r\n- ([\\#377](https://github.com/forbole/bdjuno/pull/377)) Updated Hasura metadata\r\n- ([\\#381](https://github.com/forbole/bdjuno/pull/381)) Hasura actions are now a module \r\n\r\n### Dependencies\r\n- ([\\#356](https://github.com/forbole/bdjuno/pull/356)) Updated Juno to `v3.0.0`\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forbole/callisto/releases/64204411/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forbole/callisto/releases/61571038","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forbole/callisto/releases/61571038/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/forbole/callisto/releases/61571038/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/forbole/callisto/releases/tag/v2.0.2-stargate","id":61571038,"author":{"login":"rmontagnin","id":9119016,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxMTkwMTY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9119016?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin","html_url":"https://github.com/rmontagnin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDODx6xrs4Dq3_e","tag_name":"v2.0.2-stargate","target_commitish":"v2/cosmos/stargate","name":"v2.0.2-stargate","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2022-03-11T06:46:03Z","updated_at":"2022-03-11T06:47:44Z","published_at":"2022-03-11T06:47:44Z","assets":[],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forbole/callisto/tarball/v2.0.2-stargate","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forbole/callisto/zipball/v2.0.2-stargate","body":"## Notes\r\nVersion `v2.0.2` fully replaces `v2.0.0` due to a wrong tagging being done (see #357). Please **do not use `v2.0.0` anymore and use `v2.0.2` instead.\r\n\r\n## Cosmos compatibility\r\nThis tag is thought to be used with chains that are running Cosmos **Stargate**. If you want to integrate with a chain running Cosmos `v0.43.0` or later, please use [`v2.0.2`](https://github.com/forbole/bdjuno/releases/tag/v2.0.2) instead.\r\n\r\n## Hasura actions\r\nStarting with `v2.0.0`, certain address-specific data are no longer periodically parsed from the node and stored in the database. \r\nInstead, those data are obtained directly from the node when necessary thanks to the [Hasura Actions](https://hasura.io/docs/latest/graphql/core/actions/index.html) service.\r\n\r\nHere's the list of data which are acquired through Hasura Actions:\r\n- Of a certain address/delegator:\r\n    - Account balance\r\n    - Delegation rewards\r\n    - Delegator withdraw address\r\n    - Delegations\r\n    - Total delegations amount\r\n    - Unbonding delegations\r\n    - Total unbonding delegations amount\r\n    - Redelegations\r\n- Of a certain validator:\r\n    - Commission amount\r\n    - Delegations to this validator\r\n    - Redelegations from this validator\r\n    - Unbonding delegations\r\n\r\nTo activate Hasura actoins, simply run: \r\n```\r\n$ bdjuno hasura-actions\r\n```\r\n\r\nIt is also recommended to run Hasura Actions as a system service:\r\n```shell\r\n$ sudo tee /etc/systemd/system/hasura-actions.service > /dev/null <<EOF\r\n[Unit]\r\nDescription=BDJuno Hasura Actions\r\nAfter=network-online.target\r\n[Service]\r\nUser=$USER\r\nExecStart=$GOPATH/bin/bdjuno hasura-actions\r\nRestart=always\r\nRestartSec=3\r\nLimitNOFILE=4096\r\n[Install]\r\nWantedBy=multi-user.target\r\nEOF\r\n```\r\n\r\n#### Migrate\r\nIf you are running BDJuno `v1`, you can run the following command to migrate to `v2`: \r\n```\r\nbdjuno migrate\r\n```"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forbole/callisto/releases/61571047","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forbole/callisto/releases/61571047/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/forbole/callisto/releases/61571047/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/forbole/callisto/releases/tag/v2.0.2","id":61571047,"author":{"login":"rmontagnin","id":9119016,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxMTkwMTY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9119016?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin","html_url":"https://github.com/rmontagnin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmontagnin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDODx6xrs4Dq3_n","tag_name":"v2.0.2","target_commitish":"v2/cosmos/v0.44.x","name":"v2.0.2","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2022-03-11T06:44:41Z","updated_at":"2022-03-11T06:48:09Z","published_at":"2022-03-11T06:48:09Z","assets":[],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forbole/callisto/tarball/v2.0.2","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forbole/callisto/zipball/v2.0.2","body":"## Notes\r\nVersion `v2.0.2` fully replaces `v2.0.0` due to a wrong tagging being done (see #357). Please **do not use `v2.0.0` anymore and use `v2.0.2` instead.\r\n\r\n## Cosmos compatibility\r\nThis tag is thought to be used with chains that are running Cosmos **`v0.44.0` or later**. If you want to integrate with a chain running Cosmos Stargate, please use [`v2.0.2-stargate`](https://github.com/forbole/bdjuno/releases/tag/v2.0.2-stargate) instead.\r\n\r\n## Hasura actions\r\nStarting with `v2.0.0`, certain address-specific data are no longer periodically parsed from the node and stored in the database. \r\nInstead, those data are obtained directly from the node when necessary thanks to the [Hasura Actions](https://hasura.io/docs/latest/graphql/core/actions/index.html) service.\r\n\r\nHere's the list of data which are acquired through Hasura Actions:\r\n- Of a certain address/delegator:\r\n    - Account balance\r\n    - Delegation rewards\r\n    - Delegator withdraw address\r\n    - Delegations\r\n    - Total delegations amount\r\n    - Unbonding delegations\r\n    - Total unbonding delegations amount\r\n    - Redelegations\r\n- Of a certain validator:\r\n    - Commission amount\r\n    - Delegations to this validator\r\n    - Redelegations from this validator\r\n    - Unbonding delegations\r\n\r\nTo activate Hasura actoins, simply run: \r\n```\r\n$ bdjuno hasura-actions\r\n```\r\n\r\nIt is also recommended to run Hasura Actions as a system service:\r\n```shell\r\n$ sudo tee /etc/systemd/system/hasura-actions.service > /dev/null <<EOF\r\n[Unit]\r\nDescription=BDJuno Hasura Actions\r\nAfter=network-online.target\r\n[Service]\r\nUser=$USER\r\nExecStart=$GOPATH/bin/bdjuno hasura-actions\r\nRestart=always\r\nRestartSec=3\r\nLimitNOFILE=4096\r\n[Install]\r\nWantedBy=multi-user.target\r\nEOF\r\n```\r\n\r\n#### Migrate\r\nIf you are running BDJuno `v1`, you can run the following command to migrate to `v2`: \r\n```\r\nbdjuno migrate\r\n```"}]